#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:394
#: 6da0fab01f6746dcbcf2a57c9ff39e5c
msgid ""
"All compatible RC protocols can be decoded by attaching the Receiver's "
"output to the SBUS input pin next to the Servo/Output VCC input connector. "
"Note that some protocols such as CRSF or FPort including telemetry, require "
"connection to, and setup of, one of the UARTs instead of this pin."
msgstr ""
"所有兼容 RC 协议均可通过将接收机输出连接到舵机/输出 VCC 输入接口旁的 SBUS 输入引脚来解码。注意：某些协议（如含数传的 CRSF 或 "
"FPort）需要连接到 UART 并进行相应设置，而非使用此引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:398
#: d3b1af9d7c204d318222f504b4715c76
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:400
#: 50f34dae869e419abed34681841c77bd
msgid ""
"The PixSurveyA1-IND has a built-in compass. Due to potential interference, "
"the autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a "
"GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "PixSurveyA1-IND 内置罗盘。由于潜在的干扰，飞控通常配合 GPS/罗盘组合中的外置 I2C 罗盘使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:403
#: 7ffc792c4bee4ce4b3208268d7998271
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:405
#: 1b64ba5f4ad14e8fb0764f54ca91b25b
msgid ""
"The PixSurveyA1-IND supports up to 14 PWM outputs. First first 8 outputs "
"(labelled 1 to 8) are controlled by a dedicated STM32F103 IO controller. "
"These 8 outputs support all PWM output formats, but not DShot."
msgstr ""
"PixSurveyA1-IND 支持最多 14 路 PWM 输出。前 8 路输出（标为 1 至 8）由专用 STM32F103 IO "
"控制器控制，支持所有 PWM 输出格式，但不支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:408
#: 420b5be322d240348501464edd532543
msgid ""
"The remaining 6 outputs (labelled 9 to 14) are the \"auxiliary\" outputs. "
"These are directly attached to the STM32F427 and support all PWM protocols "
"as well as DShot."
msgstr "其余 6 路输出（标为 9 至 14）为「辅助」输出，直接连接到 STM32F427，支持所有 PWM 协议以及 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:412
#: c9e3b2ba0b984c72a999edeee4dc1b11
msgid "The 8 main PWM outputs are in 3 groups:"
msgstr "8 路主 PWM 输出分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:414
#: a18428fc1e4b41ebb01aaefd5a2938aa
msgid "PWM 1 and 2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1 和 2 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:415
#: fe38be0083314ba495fcb51f9b06c137
msgid "PWM 3 and 4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3 和 4 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:416
#: 6a4035e58a7c4d0d9ea60d9c328310ea
