msgstr "PWM 5、6、7 和 8 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:418
#: 63eb04e3182a4fba8497acf5ee00bc00
msgid "The 6 auxiliary PWM outputs are in 2 groups:"
msgstr "6 路辅助 PWM 输出分为 2 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:420
#: ecdc837dc8aa40218e812be37dcc8776
msgid "PWM 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2、3 和 4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:421
#: 311a19049a7a4cd183e7491f822d949c
msgid "PWM 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5 和 6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1-IND.rst:423
#: fc6396ef8eec426b9e2ebe001a83ad70
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

